{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Paper Arcade: Pong \u00a0</strong>is a hand-drawn, chaotic spin on the classic arcade formula, set entirely on a piece of notebook paper. With charming pencil-sketch aesthetics, the game combines the familiar gameplay of pong with a sporty twist inspired by soccer. Power-ups like multiball and magnets add unpredictable variety, turning simple volleys into wild, physics-bending rallies. While built for 2-player core gameplay, <strong>Paper Pong</strong> supports up to 8 total paddles by filling the arena with AI-controlled opponents or teammates, letting you dive into solo duels, team matches, or all-out free-for-alls. It\u2019s fast, fun, and full of scrappy, sketchbook personality.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3730950?t=1752803167","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3730950?t=1752803167","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730950/b2ebfeb37177e2887d35b720a18d35eff994a3b5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752803167","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730950/b2ebfeb37177e2887d35b720a18d35eff994a3b5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752803167","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Paper Arcade: Pong \u00a0</strong>is a hand-drawn, chaotic spin on the classic arcade formula, set entirely on a piece of notebook paper. With charming pencil-sketch aesthetics, the game combines the familiar gameplay of pong with a sporty twist inspired by soccer. Power-ups like multiball and magnets add unpredictable variety, turning simple volleys into wild, physics-bending rallies. While built for 2-player core gameplay, <strong>Paper Pong</strong> supports up to 8 total paddles by filling the arena with AI-controlled opponents or teammates, letting you dive into solo duels, team matches, or all-out free-for-alls. It\u2019s fast, fun, and full of scrappy, sketchbook personality.</p>","developers":["3ichael 7ambert"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3730950/643677e5e63d20e02502cf0ecca6aa7111b8ed95/header.jpg?t=1752803167","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3730950/211757084/4a06a43e3e9769aa18533c4a92dc57bbbb7a9665/1750396377/dash_av1.mpd?t=1749325282","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3730950/211757084/4a06a43e3e9769aa18533c4a92dc57bbbb7a9665/1750396377/dash_h264.mpd?t=1749325282","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3730950/211757084/4a06a43e3e9769aa18533c4a92dc57bbbb7a9665/1750396377/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1749325282","id":257153010,"name":"Trailer 1","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257153010/a07b0061c41fc084d5d518ac439b5015761f566e/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749325282"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3730950/751391013/8f042909d53e0b8b7fc5ac762270f8389bab9438/1750396411/dash_av1.mpd?t=1749325284","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3730950/751391013/8f042909d53e0b8b7fc5ac762270f8389bab9438/1750396411/dash_h264.mpd?t=1749325284","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3730950/751391013/8f042909d53e0b8b7fc5ac762270f8389bab9438/1750396411/hls_